Now they are much better at handling
massive code bases. But there are still

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:50.239
rules of the road. There are still some
good practices which allow you to be

00:00:48.079 --> 00:00:52.800
successful as a large team. And I'd like
to go through them with you now. And I

