2026 crazy techniques. So first of all
invest time in your agents.mmd or your

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:25.200
claude.mmd in your your documentation
which is disclosed progressively only as

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:29.280
you get to the subdirectories. Make sure
that at every level at every

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:34.479
subdirectory there is great
documentation that it reflects the

00:01:32.079 --> 00:01:39.119
interface. It reflects what an agent
would need to know in order to work

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:44.079
within this this directory, this folder,
without having to read all the files.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:49.119
So, it should be like really good, tight
documentation that reflects the the the

